# Sculptures in Words — a Skia-typeset article (The Venus de Milo, etc.) whose
# letters, at the press of the round button, fly out of the page and assemble
# into a WebGPU point-sculpture of the statue (one instanced mark per glyph,
# depth-tested); in sculpture mode a paged horizontal scroll crosses between
# three sculptures (each with its own article), and pressing again flies the
# letters back into the page at the current scroll offset.
# What this test covers: reading-mode scroll (letters launch from the live
# offset), the morph both ways, reversing mid-morph, crossing to every
# sculpture and back with swipes and a half drag released early, reading the
# second article after crossing, a rapid toggle burst (the one-clock morph
# retargeted mid-flight), and scrolling the article never past its top (a
# pull-down there is the app's close gesture).
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/sculptures-in-words"
wait 2000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 30000
wait "label=\"Switch between the article and the sculpture\"" 30000
wait 2500
# Read a bit, then morph from a scrolled offset.
gesture pan 200 700 0 -400 800
wait 800
gesture pan 200 700 0 -300 600
wait 800
press "label=\"Switch between the article and the sculpture\""
wait 3500
# Back to the page, then reverse mid-morph both ways.
press "label=\"Switch between the article and the sculpture\""
wait 3500
press "label=\"Switch between the article and the sculpture\""
wait 700
press "label=\"Switch between the article and the sculpture\""
wait 700
press "label=\"Switch between the article and the sculpture\""
wait 3500
# Sculpture mode: cross to the next sculptures and back.
swipe 340 450 60 450
wait 2500
swipe 340 450 60 450
wait 2500
swipe 340 450 60 450
wait 1500
gesture pan 300 450 -120 0 900
wait 1500
swipe 60 450 340 450
wait 2500
# Read the second article (page morph from the second sculpture).
press "label=\"Switch between the article and the sculpture\""
wait 3500
gesture pan 200 700 0 -400 700
wait 800
swipe 200 750 200 200
wait 1500
gesture pan 200 300 0 300 700
wait 800
# Rapid toggles.
press "label=\"Switch between the article and the sculpture\""
wait 200
press "label=\"Switch between the article and the sculpture\""
wait 200
press "label=\"Switch between the article and the sculpture\""
wait 200
press "label=\"Switch between the article and the sculpture\""
wait 200
press "label=\"Switch between the article and the sculpture\""
wait 4000
# Back to the first sculpture and to its page.
swipe 60 450 340 450
wait 2500
press "label=\"Switch between the article and the sculpture\""
wait 3500
wait "label=\"Close\"" 15000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
